  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>When central metal ion is same (here <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>Ni</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> ), the absorption of colour depends on the ligand.</p><p>According to spectrochemical series, various ligands are as follows</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mi>Br</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mi>Cl</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msubsup><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo></msubsup><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mi>CN</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>CO</mi></math></p><p>Thus, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math>&nbsp;is the weakest ligand among these, therefore the absorbed energy will be lowest in<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Ni</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo></math> so it will absorb highest wavelength (red light).</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mo>&#8733;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math>&nbsp;The order of increasing wavelength is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Ni</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Ni</mi><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>NH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#60;</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mi>Ni</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>6</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math></p>"
  }
